#: woo-fb-tracking-server-side.php
msgid "WooCommerce plugin for Hybrid Native tracking (Meta Browser Pixel + Conversions API CAPI v21.0) with Concord GDPR consent and HPOS compatibility."
msgstr "Extension WooCommerce de tracking hybride natif (Pixel Navigateur Meta + Conversions API CAPI v21.0), 100% conforme RGPD Concord et compatible HPOS."

