#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:145
msgid "High-performance hybrid architecture (Browser fbq + Server CAPI deduplicated), 100% GDPR compliant (Concord) and WooCommerce HPOS compatible."
msgstr "Architecture hybride haute performance (Navigateur fbq + Serveur CAPI dédupliqué), 100% conforme RGPD (Concord) et compatible WooCommerce HPOS."

